---
description: >-
  a class name, member, note or relation label with a code span still reads
  the bold and italic outside the span; the span draws its backticks and the
  stars inside it as written (#836, D610)
---
classDiagram
  class A["**bold** and `code`"] {
    +run() *fast* `**not bold**`
  }
  class B
  A --> B : `x_1` and __bold__
  note for B "*italic* beside `y`"
